gine outputs stay native.\n  5. v1 scope = **all three trio lanes, Claude Code CLI only** (Gemini deferred).\n  6. Auth = **run the Anchor service as `john`**, resolving the LocalSystem credential wall.\n  7. Remote = **bind the Tailscale interface + a shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*`.\n\n- **Member document set:** Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, and Decision Log.\n\n---\n*Grounding note: every claim above is drawn from the supplied anchors. The Implementation Plan and Execution Log were listed as member documents but no excerpt content was provided, so no claims are asserted about their specifics beyond their existence.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":45166,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1227655c-adc5-4cc6-82e0-96f096baf688","uuid":"5ba057c4-f5e0-4136-862f-3517ab548bf1","request_id":"req_011Cc1JP2KBVE2oQS546BBpz"}
